  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Global Engagement, Sustainability, Education and Cooperation Fund  (GLOBUS) 2022-2029, managed by CKU</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of the GLOBUS fund is to engage Danish students and the educational sector in the UN Sustainable Development Goals, international development cooperation, and in circular economy projects alongside partners in the Global South. Moreover, GLOBUS will facilitate recycling projects wherein upcycled high-quality educational material is sent to partners in developing countries for re-use in educational settings.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To learn more: https://globuspuljen.dk/</narrative>
  </description>
